[FINAL-TEXT] **Root cause confirmed.** The process list on `router_core_2` shows only `zebra`, `mgmtd`, and `staticd` — **`ospfd` is not running**, even though `/etc/frr/daemons` has `ospfd=yes` and `/etc/frr/frr.conf` has a complete, valid OSPF stanza. The running config is therefore empty (no OSPF block ever loaded), giving the router only its three connected prefixes and no path to any remote subnet.

